        1   block-level on error undo, throw.
        2   DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER parParentProc  AS WIDGET-HANDLE NO-UNDO.
        3   define input parameter p-inkas-code like ub.inkas.inkas-code no-undo .
        4   define input parameter p-mode         as character no-undo .
        5   define output parameter p-frame-width as integer no-undo .
