      781   define NEW SHARED temp-table sj-print no-undo                                   ~
      782   field gds-code       like ub.goods.gds-code
      783   field artic          like ub.goods.artic
      784   field prod-type      like ub.goods.prod-type
      785   field prod-code      like ub.goods.prod-code
      786   field gds-name       like ub.goods.gds-name
      787   field prod-name      like ub.goods.gds-name
      788   field qnty           as   decimal
      789   field sale-sum       like ub.trn-doc.tot-sale
      790   field price-sale     like ub.gds-dtl.price-rubl
      791   field supp-type      like ub.parts.supp-type
      792   field supp-code      like ub.parts.supp-code
      793   field price-flag     as logical init no
      794   field supp-flag      as logical init no
      795   field var-purch      as integer
      796   field is-cash        as logical
      797   field is-out         as logical
      798   INDEX p1 IS PRIMARY UNIQUE
